<title>THAILAND: Thai grains discharge schedule for Jan 8.</title>
<headline>Thai grains discharge schedule for Jan 8.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent surveyors detailed grains discharges at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel	   Date of Arrival     Commodity	    Amount</p>
<p>Feng Xiang	  Jan 8	   Indian soymeal	  11,287</p>
<p>Stefan Naradia    Jan 8	   Indian soymeal	   5,489</p>
<p>					  groundnut meal	   1,040</p>
<p>Or Han Ekanci     Jan 8	   US soybean		34,539</p>
<p>Luck Nam	    Jan 9	   Indian groundnut meal  7,000</p>
<p>					  Indian soymeal	   5,000</p>
<p>Karavo Naragos    Jan 14	  Indian soymeal	  10,900</p>
<p>Hai Lee	     Jan 18	  Indian soymeal	  12,000</p>
<p>Master Panos	Jan 22	  ARG sunflower meal     4,200</p>
<p>					  ARG soybean meal	 4,000</p>
<p>Avalon		Jan 25	  US soybean		56,000</p>
<p>Song Doung	  Jan 26	     N/A</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
